        <item>
            <title>1.0.50</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>After you change your Google password,</strong> Normal Mail now notices. A banner at the top of the message list asks you to sign in again to that account, and mail starts updating again as soon as you do. Before, the account just stopped getting new mail without saying why.</li>
<li>An account no longer disappears from the sidebar if the app starts while you're offline or signed out by Google.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
