            <title>1.0.48</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>When no conversation is open, the "Sending…" card now sits neatly in the middle of the reading pane and shows who the message is going to and a preview, instead of a bare strip floating above "Select a conversation".</li>
</ul>]]></description>
